window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From a </b><b><i>New York Times</i></b><b> and </b><b><i>USA Today </i></b><b>best-selling author comes a new kind of textbook....</b></p> <p>Do you want to master German? Do you like science fiction? What about techno-thriller? Are you tired of reading boring textbooks in order to learn German?</p> <p>If you answered yes to one or more of these questions, this is an audiobook you should consider. We introduce a one-of-a-kind learning tool that will enhance your reading comprehension, improve your German vocabulary and grammar, and let you enjoy a techno-thriller novel from a <i>New York Times</i> and <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author in the process.</p>"; 
